    "title": "Plantpeddler Poinsettia Variety Day 2025 Results - NewsBreak",
    "text": "17 hours ago On a frigid December day the Poinsettia industry descended upon Cresco, Iowa, for Poinsettia Variety Day. With double digit negative temperatures outside, guests found the greenhouses warm, inviting, and colorful. For the commercial Poinsettia industry this trial has become a must-attend event. Trial attendees viewed 223 varieties. Hosted on Thursday, December 4th, representatives from all Poinsettia breeding companies, along with growers, retailers, brokers, and allied trades were in attendance. Breeders presented on their top introductions, with Mike Poretsky of A-ROO discussed value-added upgrade treatments and packaging. Additionally, Caleb Wilson of Syngenta Professional Solutions held a training on proper drench application techniques. Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak",
